{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34109","headline":"杂体诗 苦雨中又作四声诗寄鲁望 平上声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 苦雨中又作四声诗寄鲁望 平上声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河平州桥危，垒晚水鸟上。\n冲崖搜松根，点沼写芡响。\n舟轻通萦纡，栈堕阻指掌。\n携桡将寻君，渚满坐可往。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}